{"about_the_game":"These Lands is a virtual reality puzzle adventure game that leaves you marooned on an island. Following the footsteps of a long lost explorer, you must solve the puzzles to unearth the mystery hidden within. Only the most skilled, logical and brave adventurers will survive These Lands...... will you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1049510/extras/5c89ff1c95915079ef71208c8013df03.avif?t=1560956909\" width=549 height=121 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rich story revealing the mysteries of These Lands. </li><li> Become completely immersed in this beautiful low poly world. </li><li>Solve mind-bending puzzles across multiple levels while exploring These Lands. </li><li> Want to throw something, anything, everything? hundreds of interactive objects to play with. </li><li> Find all messages left behind by the long lost explorer who came before you, revealing a secret lost for millennia. </li><li> Roomscale VR Experience designed for the HTC Vive.  </li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"3fc5336b87d1fdb100d0741720f7e054953d4065.jpg","localized_name":"The Journey has just begun","name":"The Journey has just begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1049510/3fc5336b87d1fdb100d0741720f7e054953d4065.jpg"},{"icon":"934db77775648963896bfbe8e6858eb32963f44c.jpg","localized_name":"Way Up High","name":"Way Up High","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1049510/934db77775648963896bfbe8e6858eb32963f44c.jpg"},{"icon":"5aba07ec8452e3825e23228705ae4b21ce247990.jpg","localized_name":"You can't block me","name":"You can't block me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1049510/5aba07ec8452e3825e23228705ae4b21ce247990.jpg"},{"icon":"dfff240d34cd8177e606eefbddf8dfb61883d914.jpg","localized_name":"Is it just me, or are the waters rising?","nam